<title>THAILAND: Vinythai Plc Q3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Vinythai Plc Q3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for third quarter and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	 Loss   0.14     vs  Loss     2.25</p>
<p>    Net		  Loss  85.09     vs  Loss   677.46</p>
<p>Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	 Loss	 0.47     vs  Loss     2.67</p>
<p>    Net		  Loss     220.40     vs  Loss   803.64</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Vinythai Plc, a petrochemical firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
